    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Doubles Event Companion",
    "summary": "Give a Unified Force a single army-rule scope. For DRUKHARI, both armies contribute to a common Pain Token pool, with each earning tokens under Power from Pain. Armies outside a Unified Force apply their army rules separately. A Unified Force can use one set of Detachment rules across both armies when both players picked the same Detachment. In other cases, a player's Detachment rules apply only to enemy units and that player's own units. Between different Detachments in a Unified Force, a shared faction keyword and an otherwise eligible target still leave an ally's unit outside that player's Detachment Stratagems and other Detachment benefits.",
